### Test Cancellation Details API Debug

### 1. Test với ID hợp lệ
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{propertyId}}/{{bookingId}}/cancellation-details
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 2. Test với Property ID không hợp lệ
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/invalid-property-id/{{bookingId}}/cancellation-details
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 3. Test với Booking ID không hợp lệ
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{propertyId}}/invalid-booking-id/cancellation-details
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 4. Test không có token
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{propertyId}}/{{bookingId}}/cancellation-details

### 5. Test với ID rỗng
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings//{{bookingId}}/cancellation-details
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 6. Test với booking ID rỗng
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{propertyId}}//cancellation-details
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 7. Test với MongoDB ObjectId hợp lệ (24 ký tự hex)
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/507f1f77bcf86cd799439011/507f1f77bcf86cd799439012/cancellation-details
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
